Package: RPPAnalyzeR
Title: RPPA Data Analysis Pipeline for MD Anderson RPPA Core Output
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Amar", "Kumar", email = "amarcompbio@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A complete analysis pipeline for Reverse Phase Protein Array (RPPA) data
    produced by the MD Anderson Cancer Center Functional Proteomics RPPA Core.
    Handles import of all Excel sheets (L2/L3/L4 log2, linear, CHM), quality control
    filtering, differential expression analysis across time points, pathway enrichment,
    and publication-ready visualizations including heatmaps, volcano plots, and
    time-course plots.
